    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<i>&quot;This is Grove City, kid... no one really knows where the city ends and the dump starts.&quot;</i><br><br>It\u2019s garbage day! Play as raccoon thief Ricky Stripe in this fast-paced puzzle-platformer as he grapples, bounces, and rolls his way through Grove City - stealing from humans and animals alike!<br><br><strong>SWINGIN\u2019 VERMIN ACTION</strong><br>Jump, climb, roll, slide, and use your signature grappling hook to swing and launch yourself through each level! Once you\u2019ve mastered your moves, no one\u2019s trash will be safe!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/08220b22c99a6f8e012c8eaf6f65f531.poster.avif?t=1722355369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/08220b22c99a6f8e012c8eaf6f65f531.webm?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/08220b22c99a6f8e012c8eaf6f65f531.mp4?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>BECOME A HOTEL MOGUL</strong><br>The ultimate fantasy: owning property! Scour each level for pieces of furniture to place in your animal hotel! Different items will attract different guests, such as Gorfman (the legally distinct orange cat), or environmentalist author Ted Catczynski! Try to collect them all - and, yes, you can pet them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/ed64ccac9f33027ec2f825add46dd145.poster.avif?t=1722355369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/ed64ccac9f33027ec2f825add46dd145.webm?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/ed64ccac9f33027ec2f825add46dd145.mp4?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>PLAY AT YOUR OWN PACE</strong><br>Move with caution, carefully avoiding each trap and snatching every item, or fly through levels at breakneck speed, building and maintaining as much momentum as you can muster!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/35fbe24d515151aa2ca939acb4be0d1b.poster.avif?t=1722355369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/35fbe24d515151aa2ca939acb4be0d1b.webm?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/35fbe24d515151aa2ca939acb4be0d1b.mp4?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN LEVELS</strong><br>Use the level editor to make custom levels, placing platforms, enemies, traps and treasures! Download user-made levels from the Steam Workshop, and share your own!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/5be6de81b97a11093e870707654dd4eb.poster.avif?t=1722355369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/5be6de81b97a11093e870707654dd4eb.webm?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/5be6de81b97a11093e870707654dd4eb.mp4?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>&quot;This is Grove City, kid... no one really knows where the city ends and the dump starts.&quot;</i><br><br>It\u2019s garbage day! Play as raccoon thief Ricky Stripe in this fast-paced puzzle-platformer as he grapples, bounces, and rolls his way through Grove City - stealing from humans and animals alike!<br><br><strong>SWINGIN\u2019 VERMIN ACTION</strong><br>Jump, climb, roll, slide, and use your signature grappling hook to swing and launch yourself through each level! Once you\u2019ve mastered your moves, no one\u2019s trash will be safe!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/08220b22c99a6f8e012c8eaf6f65f531.poster.avif?t=1722355369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/08220b22c99a6f8e012c8eaf6f65f531.webm?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/08220b22c99a6f8e012c8eaf6f65f531.mp4?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>BECOME A HOTEL MOGUL</strong><br>The ultimate fantasy: owning property! Scour each level for pieces of furniture to place in your animal hotel! Different items will attract different guests, such as Gorfman (the legally distinct orange cat), or environmentalist author Ted Catczynski! Try to collect them all - and, yes, you can pet them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/ed64ccac9f33027ec2f825add46dd145.poster.avif?t=1722355369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/ed64ccac9f33027ec2f825add46dd145.webm?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/ed64ccac9f33027ec2f825add46dd145.mp4?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>PLAY AT YOUR OWN PACE</strong><br>Move with caution, carefully avoiding each trap and snatching every item, or fly through levels at breakneck speed, building and maintaining as much momentum as you can muster!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/35fbe24d515151aa2ca939acb4be0d1b.poster.avif?t=1722355369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/35fbe24d515151aa2ca939acb4be0d1b.webm?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/35fbe24d515151aa2ca939acb4be0d1b.mp4?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN LEVELS</strong><br>Use the level editor to make custom levels, placing platforms, enemies, traps and treasures! Download user-made levels from the Steam Workshop, and share your own!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/5be6de81b97a11093e870707654dd4eb.poster.avif?t=1722355369\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/5be6de81b97a11093e870707654dd4eb.webm?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443150/extras/5be6de81b97a11093e870707654dd4eb.mp4?t=1722355369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Master the grappling hook as you jump and swing your way through this challenging puzzle-platformer! Create and share custom levels, go fishing, and manage an animal hotel! Go fast, eat trash!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cIn Trash Bandits, Grappling Hooks, Heists, and Garbage Rats Make for a Good Time... one part tight puzzle platformer and one part hotel management sim where you lead a group of urban rodents through a series of heists... I love the ragtag dynamic of this random assortment of vermin.\u201d<br>The Escapist<br><br>\u201cIt's the perfect mix of a puzzle and platformer. Think Mario Vs. Donkey King meets Bionic Commando. The characters are well written too!\u201d<br>Big Mike<br><br>\u201cCute pixelated design, responsive control, a good level editor... indie gem here!\u201d<br>Gaming Grandma<br>",
